@741 = ~Elemental Weapon~
@742 = ~Elemental Weapon (Enchantment, Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

This spell imbues the warlord's weapon with elemental energy that deals additional damage on a hit. The warlord must choose the element enchanting his weapon when casting the spell, after which the additional damage depends on his level:
Level 7 to 10 : + 1D6
Level 11 to 14: + 1D8
Level 15 to 18: + 1D10
Level 19+     : + 1D12~
@7429 = ~You have already enchanted a weapon. You must wait until this enchantment expires to cast another one.~
@74291 = ~Elemental Weapon (Enchantment, Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: 0
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: special
Saving Throw: none

This spell enchants the warlord's weapon with elemental energy that inflicts 1D12 points of damage when it hits. The warlord must choose the element enchanting his weapon when casting the spell.~
@74292 = ~Elemental Weapon (Enchantment, Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell enchants the recipient's weapon with elemental energy that inflicts 1D12 points of damage when it hits. The warlord must choose the element enchanting the weapon when casting the spell.~
@742921 = ~The weapon of this character is already enchanted. You must wait until this enchantment expires to create another~
@742922 = ~Elemental Weapon (Enchantment, Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: one creature
Saving Throw: none

This spell enchants the recipient's weapon with elemental energy that inflicts 1D12 points of damage when it hits. The warlord must choose the element enchanting the weapon when casting the spell.

All allies within 5 meters of the recipient also benefit from reduced effects of the spell: the weapon they carry will inflict 1D10 damage of the element chosen by the warlord for 2 turns.~

@744 = ~Fireball (Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: half

The warlord creates a ball of magma that he throws at the targeted location. The ball then explodes in a wave of flame with a 9-meter radius. All creatures within the area receive 1D6 points of fire damage per level of the caster (maximum 14D6). Those who make a successful save vs. spell dodge, drop to the ground or roll aside, and receive only half damage.~
@7441 = ~Fireball (Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: radius 9 meters
Saving Throw: half

The warlord creates a ball of magma that he throws at the targeted location. The ball then explodes in a wave of flame with a 9-meter radius. All creatures within the area receive 14D6 points of fire damage. Those who make a successful save vs. spell dodge, drop to the ground or roll aside, and receive only half damage.~

@745 = ~Elemental Shield~
@746 = ~Elemental Shield (Alteration, Evocation)
Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round / level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

When he casts this spell, the warlord must choose the element against which he wishes to create a shield. He can choose fire, cold, electricity or acid. After that, flames rise high around him to protect him, whose nature and color depend on the chosen element. As long as he is covered by this shield, he gets 20% +2% per level of resistance against the chosen element, and any opponent that hits him will suffer 1D6 +3 points of damage from the elemental flames.~
@7461 = ~Burning Backlash~
@7462 = ~Freezing Backlash~
@7463 = ~Electric Backlash~
@7464 = ~Acid Backlash~
