Level: 5
Range: 0
Duration: 25 rounds
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: caster
Saving Throw: none

When he casts this spell, the warlord must choose the element against which he wishes to create a shield. He can choose fire, cold, electricity or acid. After that, flames rise high around him to protect him, whose nature and color depend on the chosen element. As long as he is covered by this shield, he gets 60% resistance against the chosen element, and any opponent that hits him will suffer 1D6 +3 points of damage from the elemental flames.~
