@749 = ~Disorder~
@7410 = ~Disorder (Enchantment)
Level: 4
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: special
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: one target
Saving Throw: negates

This spell attacks the target's mind. A failed save causes cerebral trauma. Since the warlord does not fully understand the workings of the brain, both the consequences and their duration vary: weakness, confusion, stupor, dizziness, migraine, and similar conditions. A successful dispel can shorten the effect.
From level 12, the power of the spell increases, the spell can create a more serious wound, which may cause madness, severe mental impairment or a vegetative state. In such a case, the effect will be permanent and only Greater Restoration or Wish can restore the victim's faculties.~
