@7417 = ~Frost Orb~
@7418 = ~Frost Orb (Evocation)
Level: 4
Range: visual range of the caster
Duration: instantaneous
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: radius 7.5 meters
Saving Throw: half

The spell creates a severe cold in the hands of the mage, which he compresses into an orb and immediately throws at the targeted location. It then explodes projecting cold and ice shards towards all creatures present in the area of explosion, inflicting 1 point of slashing damage and 1D4 points of cold damage per level of the caster (maximum 14D4 +14). The creatures may attempt a save vs. spell to avoid shards and thus halve the damage received.~
